      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a 29-year-old man who developed mesh rejection 3 years after laparoscopic transabdominal pre-peritoneal inguinal repair. The mesh, which was lying in a fluid cavity adherent to the urinary bladder and right iliac vessel, was removed laparoscopically."},
